            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a comprehensive review of barodontalgia, with reference to the several pathogenetic hypotheses, and insisting on the consideration of barodontalgia in the differential diagnosis of toothache. The odontologists approach to this increasing clinical problem is also discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
